{"task_id": "HumanEval/161", "solution": "def solve(s):\n    \"\"\"Reverses case of letters, keeps non-letters as is, or reverses the whole string if no letters are present.\"\"\"\n    if not any(c.isalpha() for c in s):\n        return s[::-1]\n\n    result_chars = []\n    for c in s:\n        if c.isalpha():\n            result_chars.append(c.swapcase())\n        else:\n            result_chars.append(c)\n\n    return ''.join(result_chars)"}
